# 0x008B ATTACKER_UPDATES -- server->client, 9 bytes FIXED. Mob STARTS attacking.
#
# Source: live Net-7 reference server 216.219.87.147:3573 (sector), cleartext
# proxy<->server UDP leg, SkillTrainingHostileDevice2 capture (reassembled
# inner frame; see plans/33 AF-7).
#
# Decode (AttackerUpdatesRecord + server PlayerConnection.cpp:3604-3620):
#   @0 Update 1            (01 00 00 00, little-endian -- 1 = start attacking)
#   @4 Fixed  0x01
#   @5 MobId  0x000187EC   <- BIG-ENDIAN on the wire (00 01 87 EC). The SAME mob
#                             appears as 0x0064 CLIENT_DAMAGE source 0x000187EC
#                             (little-endian) -- proving MobId here is byte-swapped.
01 00 00 00 01 00 01 87 EC
